comments[7]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-17T16:31:23.630Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: all-status exact searches for 10.75.0 and 3.8.0 returned zero; unicorn search and dependency refresh search found historical releases but no current owner. Registry publication dates are beyond the default 24-hour release-age window. Existing Vitest TypeScript and npm-package-arg major migrations are reused separately."
  "2026-09-17T16:45:20.974Z","harness:codex","Installed Sentry runtime 10.75.0, Sentry CLI 3.8.0 and Unicorn 75.0.0 with pnpm release-age protection intact. Audit of the resulting 364-dependency graph reports zero known vulnerabilities across all severities. Canonical incompatible major migrations remain separate: pm-fokyhh for Vitest 5 with CodSpeed, pm-do5b for TypeScript 7, pm-ksr40d for npm-package-arg 14 and the published Node floor."
  "2026-09-17T16:52:28.329Z","harness:codex","Public registry acceptance: exact release 2026.9.17 passed eleven cold-start CLI and SDK lifecycle steps each under independent npm and Bun installs. Candidate tarball smoke separately passed npm install, npx, bunx, package catalog/install-all, calendar workflow and a plain TypeScript SDK consumer. These prove distinct current-release and branch-artifact surfaces."
  "2026-09-17T16:56:49.748Z","harness:codex",Full-suite dependency check caught the deliberately pinned Sentry assertion still expecting 10.74.0; updated it to 10.75.0 only after packed TypeScript compilation passed. All other 8960 tests passed in that run; exact coverage remains unproven until the final rerun succeeds. The explicit pin gate remains intact.
  "2026-09-17T17:01:19.455Z","harness:codex","All linked dependency tests passed: Sentry and telemetry suites plus package-manifest contract. The package-first dogfood loop passed after sequential execution; the earlier concurrent run timed out waiting for the coverage build lease rather than executing assertions. Existing timeout limits are unchanged."
  "2026-09-17T17:24:20.672Z","harness:codex","Final local delivery evidence: full suite 8963 tests across 704 files passed; exact coverage statements 64703/64703, branches 49357/49357, functions 13438/13438, lines 61937/61937. Linked tests, Semgrep, secret scan, dependency audit, static correctness gates, unchanged idle-host performance limits, graph and record integrity, package-first dogfood and packed consumers passed. Hosted review and CI remain the next delivery stage."
  "2026-09-17T17:25:38.944Z","harness:codex","Classification correction: this is routine compatible dependency maintenance, not remediation of a known vulnerability. Both before and after audits report zero vulnerabilities; no advisory or escaped defect is attributed to these versions. Remove the overly broad security tag so the changelog and defect taxonomy do not falsely describe an ordinary refresh as a security fix. Exact coverage, pinned declaration acceptance and all dependency quality gates remain required and passed."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-17T16:52:29.153Z","harness:codex","Release scope: daily scheduled auto-release already succeeded for 2026.9.17. This branch does not trigger another same-day release. Compatible dependency changes will enter the next governed release after reviewed merge."
